├── CM4/                          Cortex-M4 project
│   ├── Core/                     Cube HAL, main.c, StartInitTask, IRQs
│   ├── Customer/                 Product code (StartCustomerTask)
│   ├── OPS_Lib/                  libops.a + include/  ← CURRENT headers
