## Boot sequence (both cores)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant M as main.c
  participant RT as FreeRTOS
  participant I as StartInitTask
  participant OPS as ops_init_*
  participant C as CustomerTask

  M->>M: HAL_Init, dual-core HSEM
  M->>RT: osKernelStart
  RT->>I: StartInitTask
  I->>OPS: ops_init_platform()
  Note over OPS: CM4 I2C EEPROM UART ADC PWM DAC FDCAN<br/>CM7 ICC LwIP KSZ WebServer
  I->>OPS: ops_init_application()
  Note over OPS: EEPROM app role Drone Cranesystem …
  I->>C: CustomerTask_Init()
  C->>C: StartCustomerTask loop
```

Public init API: `init/ops_init.h` — **only** `ops_init_platform()` + `ops_init_application()` from Core.

Application roles (`Settings/application_type.h`): `UNDEFINED`, `CRANESYSTEM`, `DRONE`, `SILAS`, `RHEOTUNE`. Drone init stub: `init/application/Drone/ops_app_drone_init.h`.

