From `CM7/Customer/Customer.h`:

| Umbrella | Pulls in |
|----------|----------|
| `peripherals/peripherals.h` | UART, I2C, SPI, GPIO, ADC, PWM, ICC, pins |
| `Settings/settings.h` | All EEPROM blocks, `settings_load_raw` / `save` |
| `devices/devices.h` | M24M01, KSZ9897, DAC084S085, LTC2870, AT24MAC402 |
| `Middleware/Middlewares.h` | Web, network, filters, mutex, watchdog, Cranesystem TX |

Prefer **narrow includes** when only one module is needed.

