### Settings blocks (representative)

`device_info`, `uart*`, `i2c*`, `fdcan`, `ain`, `adc`, `dac`, `pwm_in/out`, `network`, `ip_channel`, `gpio`, `website`, `watchdog`, … + `Applications/<Product>/` tails.

Load pattern: `settings_load_raw(PRIMARY_SETTINGS, BLOCK_*, raw, size)` → `*_unpack` → use struct → `*_pack` → `settings_save_raw`. Apply hardware via ctrl APIs (`pwm_in_ctrl`, `dac_ctrl`, …).

